ect for one another even going so  far as to refer to themselves as  brothers and after having made his first  ever friend taka would be horrified when  said friend was confirmed to be the  murderer of Chihiro Fujisaki in the  second class trial throughout the trial  taka was highly defensive Amanda and  even when it came time to vote and there  was no doubt left in anybody's minds as  to who the murderer was  taka refused to vote for mondo and  instead cast a vote for himself  following the trial taka was thrust into  a state of despair becoming near  catatonic that was brought back into  action upon discovery of alter ego whom  taka mistook for the spirit of the  murdered Chihiro in an attempt to  consult taka alter ego took on the  avatar mondo which well let's just say  it did not have the desired effect and  instead the sudden shock event occurs  mine sing mondo alive manifested his  grief into a strange new fusion  personality dubbed Kyodo as ki undertook  a sense of order became significantly  more aggressive and self-destructive  even going so far as to develop a  conflict with fellow student he Fumiya  mada / alter ego which would eventually  culminate in tacos ultimate fate in a  plot masterminded by celestial Edinburg  taka was lured into the science storage  room and bludgeoned on the back of the  head by who Fumi which killed taka  instantly and made his murder one-half  of a double bill that sparked the third  class trial which eventually culminated  in Celestia being found guilty and being  executed small fun facts about taka  despite being dead taka would go on to  appear in danganronpa  three as part of my coaches  hallucination along with the rest of the  departed members of the 70th class to  add to the great tragedy that he is  kiyotaka Ishimaru apparently the  developers were originally planning on  elaborating on his middle school life  however in their own words they stopped  because it looked like it was going to  take a dark turn and given o